zurlane.wikiru.jp/?%E7%91%9E%E9%B6%B4\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1wfyV0_30jMHmTRhq1n04e4ixWQUESZe3?usp=drive_link\n\n【服装】\n浴衣\nhttps://drive.google.com/file/d/1Nqn_j0eBvMyrCtElAeGo7EKfwCTT17TH/view?usp=drive_link\n\n【シチュエーション】\n瑞鶴、夫、義父（夫の父）の３人で温泉旅行だったが、夫は急用で帰ってしまう。\n\n１コマ目\n苦笑いしながら\n「ええと……これは仕方ないよね」\n（お義父さんは少し苦手だけど…大丈夫だよね…）と内心思う瑞鶴\n\n\n２コマ目\n浴衣を脱がされ、https://skeb.jp/@hayakawa_hayaka/works/13　のような正常位。両手を口に当てて声を我慢してる感じ。\n\n\nご検討よろしくお願いします。", "nc": 48, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@hayakawa_hayaka/works/15", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/a7f94e04/uploads/origins/1802f385-9176-4777-91cf-4b5115dcb8ff?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=72eeb1bb8945d43a2cb5bccb765ef3d1", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/a7f94e04/uploads/origins/1802f385-9176-4777-91cf-4b5115dcb8ff?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=72eeb1bb8945d43a2cb5bccb765ef3d1, https://si.imgix.net/a7f94e04/uploads/origins/1802f385-9176-4777-91cf-4b5115dcb8ff?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=8111d016d29dd57ecdd915bad8bcc5b0 2x, https://si.imgix.net/a7f94e04/uploads/origins/1802f385-9176-4777-91cf-4b5115dcb8ff?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=b5df708af33a0886ca12c3e14f2426ed 3x"}, "private": true, "genre": "art", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 1284862, "client_id": 998158, "nc": 32}, {"path": "/@hayakawa_hayaka/works/14", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/95816